	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Search and open Argo CD applications from Alfred.

argo                  → pick an instance
argo stg              → open the staging instance
argo stg checkout     → search "checkout" in staging, or open the app named "checkout"
argo checkout         → search in the default (first) instance, then the others

↩ open in browser · ⌘↩ copy URL · ⌘C copy URL

List your instances in Configure Workflow, one per line as aliases=host, e.g.
prod,production=argocd.example.com
stg,staging=argocd-staging.example.com</string>
